cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Healthy Diet Tracker"
message: "If you reference this project in academic work, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Healthy Diet Tracker Team"
repository-code: "https://github.com/leonardo-weasley/healthy-diet-tracker"
url: "https://github.com/leonardo-weasley/healthy-diet-tracker"
license: MIT
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-17
abstract: >-
  A local, single-user web application that turns a meal photo into an editable
  nutrition record. A multimodal model identifies foods and estimates portion
  weights only; all calorie and macronutrient values are computed deterministically
  in Python from a local USDA-derived food database, then stored in SQLite and
  summarized on a daily dashboard and history page.
keywords:
  - nutrition
  - diet-tracking
  - flask
  - sqlite
  - computer-vision
  - portion-estimation
  - usda-fooddata-central
references:
  - type: dataset
    title: "USDA FoodData Central"
    authors:
      - name: "U.S. Department of Agriculture, Agricultural Research Service"
    url: "https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/"
    date-accessed: 2026-11-17
